{title: Ektai Tumi}
{artist: Tahsan Khan Puja}
{key: Am}

{c: Verse 1}
[Am] Obuj mone thikana,        [Em] Tumi ki hobe
[C] Mugdho [F] amar preme [G] joriye robe,        [F] Mukhe bolo na
[C] Ke tomar [Dm] onuvobe... [G],        [Am] Amar chokher majhe
[Em] Tumi je kalo,        [C] Shopno [F] vubon jure [G] tomari aalo
[F] Ami tomake,        [C] Besechi koto [Dm] valo O [G] priyo
[Am] Tumi amar, [Em] Tumi amar,        E [F] sukhe hobe je [C] moron
[Am] Beche achi e [Em] prithibite,        [F] Ektai Tumi Je [C] Karon
[Am] Tumi amar, [Em] Tumi amar,        E [F] sukhe hobe je [C] moron
[Am] Beche achi e [Em] prithibite,        [F] Ektai Tumi Je [C] karon
[Am] Du chokhe sajano ghum,        [Em] Kere to niyecho
[F] Raater moto kore [C] kache royecho,        [Am] E mone rekhecho haath
[Em] Ki je mayate,        [F] Sukher anubhuti [C] chowate chowate
[F] Tumi shudhu je [C] amari [Dm] theko,        O [G] priyo..ho
